Cell["\<\
Width and longitudinal discrepancy measurements compare the three sizes in \
each family. The horizontal axis is the shell radius used to choose the \
endpoints.\
\>", "Text",
 CellDingbat->None,ExpressionUUID->"da1fd03e-d80d-4bc5-813e-dc4cb9512f9e"],

